dsh-bili-scroll
---------------
This plugin is a Cindy port of https://github.com/c1overzz/dsh-bili-scroll,
which is distributed under the MIT License. The daily-report format, the seen
ledger, the peak-valley window logic and the comment style gate follow that
project's design.


bilibili-api-python (reference only, no code shipped)
-----------------------------------------------------
API request shapes (WBI signing order, form fields for the comment, favorite
and DM endpoints) were copied from bilibili-api-python 17.4.2
(data/api/*.json and bilibili_api/*.py). No Python code from that project is
included in this package; only the wire format of the public Bilibili web API
is reproduced. That project is MIT licensed.

The storyboard/videoshot endpoint is referenced by URL only: no request
function, no sprite geometry and no frame extraction is implemented here.
